  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RECLAIM Sustainability! Kenya- Coffee</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims at improving the position of coffee farmers and workers in the country by promoting an innovative and inclusive private sector that sources and trades coffee transparently and responsibly. The project will contribute to an enhanced regulatory framework for coffee actors in Kenya that supports effective, transparent, inclusive and sustainable trade and support increased implementation and monitoring of recommended policies and mechanisms that support inclusive and sustainable trade by a strong and vibrant civil society.</narrative>
  </description>
